               <code>
                  <coding>
                     <system value="http://loinc.org"/>
                     <code value="8648-8"/>
                     <display value="Hospital course note"/>
                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you about the hospital course of your 73-year-old female patient, admitted on 01/10/2018 due to an acute exacerbation of her known chronic obstructive pulmonary disease. On admission, physical examination revealed reduced air entry bilaterally with expiratory wheezing. Oxygen saturation was markedly reduced at rest. Diagnostic workup included arterial blood gas analysis confirming hypercapnic respiratory failure, chest X-ray excluding pneumonia or pneumothorax, and blood tests revealing mild systemic inflammation. Treatment consisted of controlled oxygen therapy, nebulized bronchodilators (salbutamol and ipratropium), systemic corticosteroids, and intravenous fluids. The patient responded well to treatment with significant symptomatic improvement. She was discharged on 02/10/2018 with optimized inhaler therapy and a short course of oral prednisolone. Outpatient pulmonary follow-up has been arranged. Please ensure ongoing COPD monitoring and medication compliance. Kind regards, Dr. [Treating Physician].</div>
               </text>
